      "created_at": "2016-10-27T00:14:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I really want an Argent Adept unlock (any of them, not necessarily PW) to be \"Play Arcane Cadence 2/3 times in one turn\".</p><p>Fanatic could deal herself damage that reduces her to 0 or fewer HP, then come back with the Aegis. I dunno about the rest.</p><p>I do think that Fanatic, Haka and Tempest, being core characters, shouldn't need to have Argent or Cosmic on the team for their unlocks. I'm not sure if there's precedent for Handelabra doing it this way (I say that, but it's Christopher designing these), but that would prevent them from unlocking for people with just the core game.</p>",
