      "created_at": "2016-10-29T20:19:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cosmic is probably going to revolve around blowing up a bunch of your constructs (Conservation, Cataclysm, or just enemy fire, in order from most to least likely;)</p>\n<p>Fanatic should involve losing while being Redeemer Fanatic, because that’s what triggers her change in ideals.</p>\n<p>Argent Adept will likely use Silver Shadow, as the power is him accompanying himself. Maybe put so many cards in play in one turn, or something.</p>\n<p>I’m not sure on Tempest… since basically ALL of them involve playing cards in some fashion or another, it’s hard to guess what his might be. What’s the lore on him again?</p>\n<p>Haka is themed around protecting people, so maybe you have to use Intercession?</p>",
